# Go
/bin/
# Stray `go build` outputs dropped at the repo root (real sources live under
# cmd/*; the container build emits these four into /out). Root-anchored so they
# never match the cmd/jess-web source dir.
/jess-controller
/jess-worker
/jessctl
/jess-web
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# Rust (jess-web RDP render, future)
rust/**/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Local env / secrets — never commit
*.local
*.local.*
.env
*.pem
*.key

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp

# jess-web SPA build artefacts. The .gitkeep under web/dist/ pins the
# directory so go:embed works on a fresh clone before CI runs pnpm build.
cmd/jess-web/web/node_modules/
cmd/jess-web/web/dist/*
!cmd/jess-web/web/dist/.gitkeep
cmd/jess-web/web/*.tsbuildinfo
cmd/jess-web/web/.vite/
/jess-web
